    # proved mode: fake claude that misses a check, then fixes it and tries to weaken the checklist; a critic that
    # refutes once, then passes. A HUMAN line is left, so the outcome is "needs you".
    # The check sandbox can write temp folders. $HOME and this file's own directory are often temp
